<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back 2.86 mln shrs off-mkt.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back 2.86 mln shrs off-mkt.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Wednesday it had bought back a further 2.86 million of its own shares off-market from major shareholders Bell Atlantic Holdings and Ameritech Holdings.</p>
<p>The shares were bought at $6.52.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
